Explanation: প্রশ্নানুযায়ী, \frac{\sqrt{2}}{\sqrt{6} + 2}
=\frac {\sqrt{2} \left( \sqrt{6} - 2 \right)} {\left( \sqrt{6} + 2 \right) \left( \sqrt{6} - 2 \right)} \space \left[ \space \because \space লব \space ও \space হরকে \space \left( \sqrt {6} - \sqrt {2} \right) দ্বারা \space গুণ \space করে \right]
= \frac {\sqrt{2} \left( \sqrt{6} - 2 \right)} {\left(\sqrt {6}\right)^2 - \left(2\right)^2}
= \frac {\sqrt{2} \left( \sqrt{6} - 2 \right)} {6-4}
= \frac {\sqrt{2} \left( \sqrt{6} - 2 \right)} {2}
= \frac {\sqrt{12} - 2 \sqrt{2}} {2}
= \frac { 2 \sqrt{3} - 2 \sqrt{2}} {2}
= \frac{2 \left( \sqrt{3} - \sqrt{2} \right)}{2}
= \sqrt{3} - \sqrt{2} \space \bm { \left[ Ans.\right] }​

Explanation: প্রশ্নানুযায়ী, \log_{2}8
= \log_{2}2^{3}
= 3 \log_{2}2 \space [ \space \because \space \log_a {a^2} = 2 \log_a {a} ]
= 3 \times 1 \space [ \space \because \space \log_a {a} = 1 ]
= 3\space \bm { \left[ Ans.\right] }
